sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Session A
    participant MV as mv_sensor_daily
    participant B as Session B

    Note over A,B: Scenario 1 - plain REFRESH
    A->>MV: BEGIN
    A->>MV: SELECT ... (AccessShareLock held)
    MV-->>A: rows returned, txn still open
    B->>MV: REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW mv_sensor_daily
    Note right of B: needs AccessExclusiveLock -<br/>conflicts with A's lock, must wait
    A->>MV: COMMIT
    MV-->>B: refresh completes
    Note over A,B: Session B sat blocked the whole time

    Note over A,B: Scenario 2 - REFRESH ... CONCURRENTLY
    A->>MV: BEGIN
    A->>MV: SELECT ... (AccessShareLock held)
    MV-->>A: rows returned, txn still open
    B->>MV: REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY mv_sensor_daily
    Note right of B: needs only ExclusiveLock -<br/>compatible with AccessShareLock
    MV-->>B: refresh completes immediately
    Note over A,B: Neither session blocks
    A->>MV: COMMIT
